#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:258
msgid "The views were restructured, so check your theme if you customized it."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:263
msgid ""
"A new option in site settings and in block settings allows to display the "
"selection flat, by default, or hierarchically."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:268
msgid ""
"A new option in site settings allows to define selectable resources (items, "
"medias, item sets)."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:273
msgid ""
"The resource block \"Selection\" was split into a block \"Selection\" and a "
"block \"Selection list\"."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:278
msgid ""
"Modules {link_1}Bulk Export{link_end} and {link_2}Contact Us{link_end} are "
"fully integrated in the selection page."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:361
msgid ""
"The setting \"heading\" was removed from block Selection. New blocks "
"\"Heading\" or \"Html\" were prepended to all blocks that had a filled "
"heading. You may check pages for styles: {json}"
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:371
msgid ""
"The setting \"template\" was moved to the new block layout settings "
"available since Omeka S v4.1. You may check pages for styles: {json}"
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:378
msgid ""
"The template files for the block Selection should be moved from \"view/"
"common/block-layout\" to \"view/common/block-template\" in your themes. You "
"may check your themes for pages: {json}"
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:413
msgid ""
"A new option is added to display selection button and list before, after or "
"via resource blocks. See site settings."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:443
msgid ""
"The view helpers \"selectionButtonToggle\", \"showSelectionLink\", "
"\"updateSelectionLink\" , and \"containerSelection\" were renamed "
"\"selectionButton\", \"selectionList\", \"selectionLinkBrowse\", and "
"\"selectionContainer\". You should update your theme. Matching templates: "
"{json}"
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:489
msgid ""
"The js \"selection.js\" was simplified to use \"common-dialog.js\", that "
"should be added to the templates. You should check your theme. Matching "
"templates: {json}"
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:496
msgid ""
"The js \"selection.js\" was simplified to use \"common-dialog.js\", that "
"should be added to the templates. You should check your theme."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:519
msgid ""
"It is now possible to display a flat list of named selections of resources."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:557
msgid ""
"It is now possible to define the main mode of process by site: the user can "
"manage a single selection or multiple selections."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:562
msgid "It is now possible to publish selection and to moderate them."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:567
msgid ""
"Many urls for selections was modified, so check the menu and the theme if "
"customized."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:600
msgid ""
"A \"default\" flag has been added on selections to designate the favorites "
"basket for each user. The oldest selection of each user has been promoted as "
"default."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:620
msgid ""
"The selection modes and labels for visitors and users are now configured "
"separately in site settings."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:675
msgid ""
"Selection options now use two orthogonal axes per role: \"Favorites\" "
"(single basket) and \"Selections\" (multiple named lists). Existing settings "
"have been migrated. Review them in site settings."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:685
msgid ""
"Selection routes have been clarified: the personal area is now exclusively "
"under \"/guest/selection\" and \"/guest/favorites\". Update your bookmarks, "
"theme overrides and external links accordingly."
msgstr ""

